{"date":"1985-08-17","platform":"剧场版","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/4f/d6/136884_PJt5J.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/4f/d6/136884_PJt5J.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/4f/d6/136884_PJt5J.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/4f/d6/136884_PJt5J.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/4f/d6/136884_PJt5J.jpg"},"summary":"　　在美国的一部著名早期动画作品《铁骑惊魂》中，有一个经典场景：五花大绑的女王被扔在铁轨上，竭力地嘶喊着：“救救我！”这个经典场景最早源自于无声喜剧时期的系列剧。而在《残片》这部短片中，也出现了类似的情景：一位西部英雄试图拯救陷入相同困境的美女，经过一番激战，最终击败了恶徒，成功地实现了英雄救美。然而，这个经典场景已经“经典”到破旧不堪，电影胶片上布满了刮痕、污渍，甚至出现破损，导致画面错乱。英雄在与恶徒搏斗的同时，还不得不与自己所在的电影胶片进行艰苦的斗争。","name":"おんぼろフィルム","name_cn":"残片","tags":[{"name":"短片","count":57,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手塚治虫","count":42,"total_cont":0},{"name":"1985","count":29,"total_cont":0},{"name":"原创","count":13,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手塚PRODUCTION","count":11,"total_cont":0},{"name":"实验","count":8,"total_cont":0},{"name":"虫Production","count":5,"total_cont":0},{"name":"剧场版","count":5,"total_cont":0},{"name":"日本","count":3,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手塚PRO","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手塚プロダクション","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手冢Production","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"上世纪","count":2,"total_cont":0},{"name":"Short_film","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"这TMD是艺术！","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"日本动画","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"OVA","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"独立短片","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"旧物","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"手冢治虫","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"1980s","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"院线观看","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"1985年8月","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"60年代","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"短編","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"1985年","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"动画的世纪","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"动画","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"搞笑","count":1,"total_cont":0},{"name":"80s","count":1,"total_cont":0}],"infobox":[{"key":"中文名","value":"残片"},{"key":"别名","val